+  // Rewrites the network-quality fields of |state| from the device profile.
+  // Does nothing when this process has no profile or the profile carries no
+  // network section, which leaves the host's own estimate in place.
+  //
+  // Applied to the stored state at construction and after each setter that
+  // touches those fields, rather than inside the accessors, because the
+  // observer notification path reads the same struct: a page that installs a
+  // change listener takes its values from ConnectionChange, and a page that
+  // does not takes them from the accessors. Overriding one and not the other
+  // would make the two disagree.
+  static void ApplyProfileNetworkQuality(NetworkState& state);
